+- `dotnet test tests/StrictSharp.Analyzers.Tests/StrictSharp.Analyzers.Tests.csproj --no-restore`
+- `node .codex/skills/spectro-gates/scripts/run_gates.mjs --feature-id csharp-performance-analyzer-v4`
